Bruno Kazer wrote:

 > I would claim that the only thing that barbarian lacks by
 > comparison to the valk is the dipped artifact weapon.

Barbarians also allow for a similiar "no clever thinking required"
approach. They even have the advantage of poison resistance.

Getting Excalibur is no minor thing though, as it is one of the best
weapons you can get, and getting it that early helps a lot. Valks also
start with a +3 small shield. Law Val also have peaceful Mines, unlike
Barbs who always have hostile Mines.

 > Barbarians are lethal in hand to hand combat.

Against grid bugs maybe #-). Bare hands does only minimal damage on
its own. When you use it, you benefit mostly from regular strength
bonus. I'd rather wield a weapon.

 > Also, barbarians can be male.

Gender only matters in a few very specific cases.

